List of Components in the kit

1× Arduino Uno, 
1× breadboard, 
1× FSR, 
1× 10 kΩ potentiometer, 
1× push button, 
1× red LED, 
1× LDR, 
5× resistors (220/330 Ω and 10 kΩ), 
~20× male-to-male jumper wires, 
1× USB cable, and 
1× ADXL345 or MPU-6050 accelerometer module.


Notes:
For the LED you need resistor 220Ω
For the button, LDR, Photoresistor and Force Sensor you need 10kΩ
